{"id":"e6df37cab7bc6f11","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/07_system_f.md","title":"显式 System F：双绑定检查与固定 PER 语义","display":"显式 System F：双绑定检查与固定 PER 语义","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","specification"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>specification</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"1.-类型与检查器\">1. 类型与检查器</h2>\n<p>类型指标 0 指最近类型绑定，项指标 0 指最近项绑定；两种深度分开。类型有 TV、箭头、∀；项有变量、带类型注解 λ、应用、类型抽象、显式类型应用。d 是当前自由类型环境长度，Γ 中每个类型均在 d 良构。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8ed31ea0d65b588\" href=\"?note=d8ed31ea0d65b588\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTy\">PolyTy</a></td>\n<td><code>d, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7bbe24e1af27299d\" href=\"?note=7bbe24e1af27299d\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyRaw\">PolyRaw</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c50c8794e300e443\" href=\"?note=c50c8794e300e443\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCtx\">PolyCtx</a></td>\n<td><code>d, g</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44829a217799408a\" href=\"?note=44829a217799408a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCtxLift\">PolyCtxLift</a></td>\n<td><code>g, h</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de2d60bf72fd6cc5\" href=\"?note=de2d60bf72fd6cc5\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyType\">PolyType</a></td>\n<td><code>d, g, t, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"19864c2706f56675\" href=\"?note=19864c2706f56675\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyEval\">PolyEval</a></td>\n<td><code>d, g, t, r</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac0d7af354f31240\" href=\"?note=ac0d7af354f31240\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolySynth\">PolySynth</a></td>\n<td><code>d, g, t, r</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ffceeafdf689edfc\" href=\"?note=ffceeafdf689edfc\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCheck\">PolyCheck</a></td>\n<td><code>d, g, t, a, b</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1f2a6a2e1de8a327\" href=\"?note=1f2a6a2e1de8a327\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCheckerCorrect\">PolyCheckerCorrect</a></td>\n<td>``</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>五个综合分支：变量查 Γ；λ 综合体并形成箭头；应用比较域；类型抽象先将 Γ 全部类型自由指标提升一位，在 d+1 下综合体，再加 ∀；类型应用要求函数综合结果是 ∀A，并以显式参数类型实例化 A。失败分支都写入 PolyEval，不用先判定 PolyType 再伪装成算法。</p>\n<p>终止度量是输入项的有限构造树；类型操作也沿有限类型树下降。对应于 PolyType 的五规则可作双向归纳，但完整内核推导尚未提供。Curry 风格 System F 不属于这个总算法声明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-双绑定替换\">2. 双绑定替换</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c2fe7abb9b79960a\" href=\"?note=c2fe7abb9b79960a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTyShift\">FTyShift</a></td>\n<td><code>c, k, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"49b51d8f3325b677\" href=\"?note=49b51d8f3325b677\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTyInst\">FTyInst</a></td>\n<td><code>c, s, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"965ca82b4d5c104e\" href=\"?note=965ca82b4d5c104e\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermsShift\">PolyTermsShift</a></td>\n<td><code>c, k, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a86c2a4bbdf161b3\" href=\"?note=a86c2a4bbdf161b3\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypesShift\">PolyTypesShift</a></td>\n<td><code>c, k, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"67cfda1c3884c68c\" href=\"?note=67cfda1c3884c68c\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermInst\">PolyTermInst</a></td>\n<td><code>c, h, s, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"d5ecfacd107be1a9\" href=\"?note=d5ecfacd107be1a9\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeInstTerm\">PolyTypeInstTerm</a></td>\n<td><code>c, s, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"3fcb258adfca5c2d\" href=\"?note=3fcb258adfca5c2d\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyStep\">PolyStep</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"de2abfc643da7633\" href=\"?note=de2abfc643da7633\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyConvert\">PolyConvert</a></td>\n<td><code>d, g, t, u, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>FTyInst 删除一个类型绑定，命中时提升插入类型，大于截止值的指标减一。项替换 PolyTermInst 带两参数 c、h：c 只随项 λ 增加，h 只随类型抽象增加；命中时对插入项先提升自由类型指标 h，再提升自由项指标 c。类型代换遍历每个类型注解；普通项 λ 不改变类型截止值，类型抽象才增加。</p>\n<p>回归专门覆盖“插入项有自由类型注解，目标位置位于类型抽象之下”的反例，这是仅提升项指标的错误实现会漏掉的情形。同类型转换列不省略中间项的类型条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3.-集合大小-PER-解释\">3. 集合大小 PER 解释</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"bef032c6dfb2940e\" href=\"?note=bef032c6dfb2940e\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombAlgebra\">CombAlgebra</a></td>\n<td><code>D, ap, k, s</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"316e4260b85137de\" href=\"?note=316e4260b85137de\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombAbstract\">CombAbstract</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"5cd32a06fd4a9374\" href=\"?note=5cd32a06fd4a9374\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombCompile\">CombCompile</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"688e0ea28a1311cc\" href=\"?note=688e0ea28a1311cc\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyErase\">PolyErase</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"25f8fb4dddc2a4b4\" href=\"?note=25f8fb4dddc2a4b4\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombEval\">CombEval</a></td>\n<td><code>D, ap, k, s, e, t, v</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"558dd759e3fb9283\" href=\"?note=558dd759e3fb9283\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PartialEquiv\">PartialEquiv</a></td>\n<td><code>D, R</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"b398cfc0d4c41817\" href=\"?note=b398cfc0d4c41817\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PERSpace\">PERSpace</a></td>\n<td><code>D, P</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-25\" data-note=\"fbb658acd5de4a50\" href=\"?note=fbb658acd5de4a50\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PERArrow\">PERArrow</a></td>\n<td><code>D, ap, A, B, R</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-26\" data-note=\"3e052fdd1e781abd\" href=\"?note=3e052fdd1e781abd\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeTable\">PolyTypeTable</a></td>\n<td><code>D, ap, V</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-27\" data-note=\"fbb6c80f258d8724\" href=\"?note=fbb6c80f258d8724\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyInterpret\">PolyInterpret</a></td>\n<td><code>D, ap, d, rho, a, R</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-28\" data-note=\"0e734c6827b2426f\" href=\"?note=0e734c6827b2426f\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermEnv\">PolyTermEnv</a></td>\n<td><code>D, ap, d, rho, g, e</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-29\" data-note=\"c2d70d09f89c8624\" href=\"?note=c2d70d09f89c8624\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyDenote\">PolyDenote</a></td>\n<td><code>D, ap, k, s, d, rho, g, t, a, e, v</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>固定集合 D 上的总应用图 ap 及满足 K、S 方程的 k、s。PER 是 D 平方的对称传递子关系，不要求全域自反。所有 PER 在 P(D×D) 内分离成集合。箭头关系由应用保持参数关系到结果关系定义；∀ 类型解释为对这个固定 PER 集合的交，不量化所有集合大小的载体。</p>\n<p>项先抹除类型，再用显式 SK 括号抽象消去 λ，在合法环境下由总应用求值。括号抽象的变量 0 用 SKK，其他变量/常项用 K，应用用 S。基本引理需要证明环境关系保持、类型替换解释一致及括号抽象的性质；当前只给出完整定义和义务，<strong>没有给出这些一般引理的 ZFC 内核证书</strong>。语义等式应是相应 PER 的相关性，不自动等于 D 中值的字面相等。非平凡组合代数模型存在性也不是这里已经证明的结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-类型与检查器","text":"1. 类型与检查器","level":2},{"id":"2.-双绑定替换","text":"2. 双绑定替换","level":2},{"id":"3.-集合大小-PER-解释","text":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTy","status":"resolved","id":"d8ed31ea0d65b588","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 类型与检查器","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyRaw","status":"resolved","id":"7bbe24e1af27299d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 类型与检查器","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyRaw|PolyRaw]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCtx","status":"resolved","id":"c50c8794e300e443","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 类型与检查器","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCtx|PolyCtx]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCtxLift","status":"resolved","id":"44829a217799408a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 类型与检查器","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCtxLift|PolyCtxLift]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyType","status":"resolved","id":"de2d60bf72fd6cc5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 类型与检查器","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyType|PolyType]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyEval","status":"resolved","id":"19864c2706f56675","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 类型与检查器","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyEval|PolyEval]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolySynth","status":"resolved","id":"ac0d7af354f31240","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 类型与检查器","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolySynth|PolySynth]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCheck","status":"resolved","id":"ffceeafdf689edfc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 类型与检查器","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCheck|PolyCheck]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCheckerCorrect","status":"resolved","id":"1f2a6a2e1de8a327","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 类型与检查器","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCheckerCorrect|PolyCheckerCorrect]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTyShift","status":"resolved","id":"c2fe7abb9b79960a","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 双绑定替换","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTyShift|FTyShift]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTyInst","status":"resolved","id":"49b51d8f3325b677","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 双绑定替换","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTyInst|FTyInst]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermsShift","status":"resolved","id":"965ca82b4d5c104e","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 双绑定替换","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermsShift|PolyTermsShift]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypesShift","status":"resolved","id":"a86c2a4bbdf161b3","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 双绑定替换","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypesShift|PolyTypesShift]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermInst","status":"resolved","id":"67cfda1c3884c68c","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 双绑定替换","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermInst|PolyTermInst]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeInstTerm","status":"resolved","id":"d5ecfacd107be1a9","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 双绑定替换","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeInstTerm|PolyTypeInstTerm]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyStep","status":"resolved","id":"3fcb258adfca5c2d","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 双绑定替换","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyStep|PolyStep]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyConvert","status":"resolved","id":"de2abfc643da7633","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 双绑定替换","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyConvert|PolyConvert]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombAlgebra","status":"resolved","id":"bef032c6dfb2940e","anchor":"ref-18","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombAlgebra|CombAlgebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombAbstract","status":"resolved","id":"316e4260b85137de","anchor":"ref-19","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombAbstract|CombAbstract]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombCompile","status":"resolved","id":"5cd32a06fd4a9374","anchor":"ref-20","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombCompile|CombCompile]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyErase","status":"resolved","id":"688e0ea28a1311cc","anchor":"ref-21","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyErase|PolyErase]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombEval","status":"resolved","id":"25f8fb4dddc2a4b4","anchor":"ref-22","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombEval|CombEval]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PartialEquiv","status":"resolved","id":"558dd759e3fb9283","anchor":"ref-23","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PartialEquiv|PartialEquiv]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PERSpace","status":"resolved","id":"b398cfc0d4c41817","anchor":"ref-24","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PERSpace|PERSpace]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PERArrow","status":"resolved","id":"fbb658acd5de4a50","anchor":"ref-25","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PERArrow|PERArrow]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeTable","status":"resolved","id":"3e052fdd1e781abd","anchor":"ref-26","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeTable|PolyTypeTable]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyInterpret","status":"resolved","id":"fbb6c80f258d8724","anchor":"ref-27","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyInterpret|PolyInterpret]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermEnv","status":"resolved","id":"0e734c6827b2426f","anchor":"ref-28","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermEnv|PolyTermEnv]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyDenote","status":"resolved","id":"c2d70d09f89c8624","anchor":"ref-29","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 集合大小 PER 解释","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyDenote|PolyDenote]]","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":4731,"backlinks":[{"id":"2a802213915eee42","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[07_system_f]]"},{"id":"feb5357ce56a8ac2","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 [[000_ZFC/07_system_f]]。纯语言约定见 [[000_ZFC/01_language]]，有限证明列的读法见 [[000_ZFC/02_proofs]]。"}],"outgoing":["d8ed31ea0d65b588","7bbe24e1af27299d","c50c8794e300e443","44829a217799408a","de2d60bf72fd6cc5","19864c2706f56675","ac0d7af354f31240","ffceeafdf689edfc","1f2a6a2e1de8a327","c2fe7abb9b79960a","49b51d8f3325b677","965ca82b4d5c104e","a86c2a4bbdf161b3","67cfda1c3884c68c","d5ecfacd107be1a9","3fcb258adfca5c2d","de2abfc643da7633","bef032c6dfb2940e","316e4260b85137de","5cd32a06fd4a9374","688e0ea28a1311cc","25f8fb4dddc2a4b4","558dd759e3fb9283","b398cfc0d4c41817","fbb658acd5de4a50","3e052fdd1e781abd","fbb6c80f258d8724","0e734c6827b2426f","c2d70d09f89c8624"]}